Our official launch film for the DJI Osmo Pocket 4P is now live! 
Earlier this year, DJI approached us to concept, direct, shoot and edit the global launch campaign for their most anticipated release of the year. What followed was one of the most creatively demanding and rewarding productions we’ve taken on. Navigating tight timelines, constant movement and a rapidly evolving production schedule across three countries in under a month. 
From early mornings navigating unfamiliar cities to late nights turning around edits between flights, this campaign pushed every part of our team creatively and logistically. From day one, the goal was to position the Pocket 4P as a highly capable, professional filmmaking tool for creators constantly on the move, naturally showcasing and educating its features through real-world moments and environments. 
Massive thank you to the incredible cast and crew who trusted the process, adapted under pressure and brought so much energy into every stage of production. This one genuinely would not have been possible without the passion and resilience of everyone involved.
